# Build outputs: `nix build` / `nixos-rebuild build` drop a ./result symlink
result
result-*

# VM disk images created by `nixos-rebuild build-vm` (run from the repo dir)
*.qcow2

# Direnv, if you ever adopt it
.direnv/

# Machine-local hyprland fragment: THIS machine's monitor config
# (hl.monitor lines — resolution/scale/position/VRR), hand-maintained.
# Syncing it between hosts would apply one machine's monitors to the
# other, so it's local-only; home/hyprland.nix's activation script seeds
# it empty on a fresh clone (require() hard-fails on a missing file, but
# an empty Lua chunk is fine — auto monitor config until real lines land).
home/hypr/local/outputs.lua
